{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_001har_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_3000_place", "source_sha256": "2f549a5e31fe3c529f3f1cb2c891601ea53e1c6766c8ccc67e43e5870e8bfa08", "ja": "収録スタジオ", "zh": "录音室", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_001har_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_3001_001har", "source_sha256": "e6fca11fb8eb76b234f93f1d10531612f59eaf904421f14061ab51cedd01a631", "ja": "うう……あの、{$P$}さん、\nちょっといいですか？", "zh": "呜呜……请问，{$P$}先生。\n可以打扰一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_001har_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_3002_p", "source_sha256": "d296a5562a88e7d70d601c15e1a27e900ed817bcdfc02850d2f511f307e38ded", "ja": "どうした、春香？　CGアニメ映画の吹き替え台本、\nひと通り読み終わったのか？", "zh": "怎么了，春香？CG动画电影的配音剧本，\n你已经都看过一遍了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_001har_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_3003_001har", "source_sha256": "dcb07cbb872c67ddad806e81a0273a6d782721b6e83b7d4efb7650b13e9bde70", "ja": "はい、読み終わりました。でも……。\nキリン役って、本当に動物のキリンだったんです！", "zh": "是的，我都看完了，可是……\n这个长颈鹿的角色，就是动物的那个长颈鹿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_001har_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_3004_p", "source_sha256": "6b288a34e5ff7fda8f54cd2ef3130c0606fb9d13b2d6acfc3a1f361803d8b5b9", "ja": "そうか。擬人化されてない本物だったのか。\n……となると、難しそうだな。", "zh": "这样啊，原来不是拟人，而是真的动物。\n……这样的话，演起来似乎会很困难。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_001har_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_3005_001har", "source_sha256": "f06aeaaa8742cade6625c354ab43da7aa2c5c9c64de2bbcb62819df7610286a5", "ja": "はい……キリンはカワイイって思いますけど、\nキリンの感情って言われても……。うう……。", "zh": "是的……我是觉得长颈鹿很可爱，但是……\n要我诠释长颈鹿的感情也很头痛啊……呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_001har_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_3006_001har", "source_sha256": "6f55a5bb619cad3614bfede247bbef65a4d01ba3f3acd13f83de5ce8e48daed9", "ja": "あの、キリンをうまく演じるためには、\nどうしたらいいんでしょう？", "zh": "请问，为了顺利饰演长颈鹿，\n我应该怎么办才好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_001har_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_3007_p", "source_sha256": "f35629eb75a448b33641b9032856869050fcb1254643b73a334db7d47ffc796f", "ja": "うーん、そうだなぁ……。", "zh": "唔～这个嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_001har_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_3008", "source_sha256": "43c71e5043e6e4171efc073fba1c6be86ecaef4a77ab685e613bd92ac9f94387", "ja": "キリンを観察", "zh": "观察长颈鹿", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_001har_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_3009", "source_sha256": "b130220d043b3f34437eea8715063d02f89957287e5d5a227621dd02f23b5405", "ja": "キリンになりきる", "zh": "化身为长颈鹿", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_001har_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_3200_p", "source_sha256": "5b7629180637f76d1fc7fc55caee7b21b3f3bfab595523b0c610f0e53d7280bb", "ja": "キリンを演じるには、まずキリンを知らないと……\nよし、これから観察しに行こう！", "zh": "想要饰演长颈鹿的话，首先得要了解长颈鹿……\n好，现在就去观察长颈鹿吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_001har_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_3201_001har", "source_sha256": "e26a195120100f1fc78adaf3279bcd4eb46fe80cb551beae6cc92eeacde8844d", "ja": "えっ、今からですか！？　わ、わかりました。\nとにかく、すぐ支度しますね……！", "zh": "咦，现在吗！？我、我知道了。\n总之，我马上去准备喔……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_001har_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_3202_001har", "source_sha256": "6117f52ef44ca6bf04dff27be92b3e7943a61cd7ff884eeb6929f5fc5d8bb7d6", "ja": "{$P$}さんと一緒に動物園なんて。　\nいつの間にか、気分も晴れちゃいました。えへへっ♪", "zh": "没想到能和{$P$}先生一起来动物园。\n连心情也不知不觉间好起来了，嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_001har_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_3300_p", "source_sha256": "5b7629180637f76d1fc7fc55caee7b21b3f3bfab595523b0c610f0e53d7280bb", "ja": "キリンを演じるには、まずキリンを知らないと……\nよし、これから観察しに行こう！", "zh": "想要饰演长颈鹿的话，首先得要了解长颈鹿……\n好，现在就去观察长颈鹿吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_001har_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_3301_001har", "source_sha256": "e26a195120100f1fc78adaf3279bcd4eb46fe80cb551beae6cc92eeacde8844d", "ja": "えっ、今からですか！？　わ、わかりました。\nとにかく、すぐ支度しますね……！", "zh": "咦，现在吗！？我、我知道了。\n总之，我马上去准备喔……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_001har_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_3302_001har", "source_sha256": "b4bd7f9e7991244643c6ab1fa848a37059ff82a798f2838855024e7c7c745b07", "ja": "4時間まって、やっとキリンの鳴き声が聞けました\nけど……。ウシにそっくりじゃないですか……？", "zh": "等了四个小时，总算是听到长颈鹿的叫声了……\n可是，和牛的叫声不是一模一样吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_001har_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_3500_p", "source_sha256": "22fd3f268eb7edc005578031c0fb39aa30ceae381b13176af7ed31276bbb1240", "ja": "キリンになりきって、\n気持ちを想像してみるのはどうだ？", "zh": "化身为长颈鹿，\n试着想像长颈鹿的心情如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_001har_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_3501_001har", "source_sha256": "fc941cd5c316717e7e5ce1d5f8f416dc08cf7245988084c286e1b95a50d5bbc5", "ja": "そっか……。演じるんじゃなくて、\n自分がキリンだったらって思ってみるんですね？", "zh": "原来是这样……不是去想如何饰演，\n而是试着思考自己如果是长颈鹿会怎么想，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_001har_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_3502_001har", "source_sha256": "b51e9268bd43cae9c8b617f6724203fa30ec1597f33fd82a44b90e7b0ca8c655", "ja": "なんだか、ちょっと希望が出てきました！\nこれで一歩、前に進めそうです♪", "zh": "总觉得，好像有一点希望了！\n这下子似乎就能跨出第一步了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_001har_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_3600_p", "source_sha256": "22fd3f268eb7edc005578031c0fb39aa30ceae381b13176af7ed31276bbb1240", "ja": "キリンになりきって、\n気持ちを想像してみるのはどうだ？", "zh": "化身为长颈鹿，\n试着想像长颈鹿的心情如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_001har_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_3601_001har", "source_sha256": "a5cbef412f855373c314c34e24df7855c3eade12803b23f37dd488e64856a265", "ja": "えっ、キ、キリンになりきるんですか……？\nなんだか難しそうですけど、とにかくやってみます！", "zh": "咦，化、化身成长颈鹿吗……？\n感觉好像很难，总之我先试试看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_001har_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_3602_001har", "source_sha256": "969f98a6319b7ee161551ea4cbd2aff47971dc108ff03c23e77ac6486ba2c8c7", "ja": "うーん、ここは……サバンナ……。あっ、ライオンから\n逃げなきゃ！　ああっ、葉っぱがあんな上の方に～！", "zh": "唔～这里是……热带草原……啊，我得逃离狮子才行！\n啊啊，树叶居然在那么高的地方～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
